der-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;\">{{ doc.mobile_number or 'N/A' }}</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;width:40%;\"><b style=\"color:#5b6b7b;\">Contact Email</b></td><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;\">{{ doc.email_id or 'N/A' }}</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<p>If needed, please follow up with the visitor or cancel the pass.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 16px;\"><a style=\"color: #1e40af;\" href=\"{{ frappe.utils.get_url() }}/app/visitor-pass/{{ doc.name }}\">View Pass</a></p>\n</div>",
